  "ruleText": "Gen 301.03 “National examination in genetic counseling” means the American Board of Genetic Counseling or American Board of Medical Genetics exam or the successor organizations.\n\nSource. #10686, eff 10-7-14; ss by #14337, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
